    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my doctor said my inr is up to 4.2 today which is higher than usual... i'm on warfarin. is that super dangerous?? can i just eat more greens or take some vitamins to bring it back down to a normal level myself? i dont really want to go back to the clinic if i dont have to",
